kAI voice bench (KaiSpeech), not part of the ROM.

Build (after kAI has been built once, from the source tree root): bash build.sh
Run on a phone with the voice in /system/usr/share/kai/voice:
  adb push voicetest.jar /data/local/tmp/
  adb shell 'CLASSPATH=/data/local/tmp/voicetest.jar app_process /system/bin \
      com.kiroos.kai.VoiceTest it "Ciao!"'
It prints when each sentence was heard; logcat -s kAI shows load and synthesis times.
